# Which legacy Compose service reads which path of the repository.
#
# One line per path: "<prefix> <service>". The prefix is relative to the
# repository root; a prefix ending in "/" matches everything below that
# directory, any other prefix matches exactly that file. A service without
# files in the repository (an image only) has the prefix "-".
#
# Used by .github/ci/affected.sh to decide which legacy service the deployment
# recreates. Legacy is frozen, so this list is not expected to grow.
# .github/ci/affected.test.sh fails when it is out of step with
# legacy/docker-compose.yaml.
#
# prefix                                   legacy Compose service
legacy/frontend/                           frontend
legacy/dashboard-v2/                       dashboard-v2
legacy/mqtt-ws-bridge/                     mqtt-ws-bridge
legacy/fake-sensors/                       fake-sensors
legacy/backend/sensor-data-generator/      quarkus-app
legacy/telegraf.conf                       telegraf
legacy/grafana/                            grafana
-                                          influxdb
